Channels & Polling):** Configure how `checkout-front` renders the step (`SHOW_OTP_FORM`, `HTTP_REDIRECT`, `RENDER_EMBEDDED`, `SHOW_QR_OR_CODE`, `SHOW_PUSH_OR_TRANSFER`), configure the webhook `path_token` and verification method (setting `must_inquire = true` on any weak/IP-only channel), and set the background `PollPolicy` backoff (`[5, 10, 20, 40, 60]` seconds).\n- **Step 7 (Status Rules, Error Map, Amount Scale & Statement Parser):** Map gateway codes to canonical statuses (`SUCCEEDED`, `FAILED`, `AWAITING_CUSTOMER`, `UNKNOWN`) and Error Classifications (`RETRYABLE_OTP` vs `TERMINAL_DECLINE` vs `LIMIT_EXCEEDED` vs `GATEWAY_FAULT`). Set `amount_scale` (`1`, `100`, `1000`), `amount_precision` (`0`, `2`, `3`), and `amount_rounding`, and map the CSV/XLSX/JSON columns for daily `StatementSource` reconciliation.\n- **Step 8 (Dry-Run, 15-Scenario Sandbox Suite, 12 Gates & Maker-Checker Submit):** Run the automated **15-Scenario Suite**, select a `rollback_version_id`, verify all 12 Go-Live Gates are green, and click **Submit for Checker Approval**.",
